{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":37140,\"title\":\"Naked Beneath the Water\",\"tagline\":\"Lights! Camera! Murder!\",\"overview\":\"Pelle's brother has been missing for a month when a mysterious phone call tells him to watch the top rated reality show, Public Enemy Number One. It's a nasty piece of work where contestants tape their murders and battle it out to be the top killer for that year. When Pelle sees the episode in question he realizes the brutal chainsaw murder was filmed in his brother's apartment. Going there, he searches to find out if the footage is real. Little does he know that he's stepped into ground zero for a pitched battle of famous past Public Enemies and those who would take their place.\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"year\":2006,\"runtime\":83,\"genres\":[\"Horror\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Sean Cain\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":101183,\"name\":\"Sean Cain\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gg4xvFM7Vkb1jUVwmJCEilKtKx8.jpg\"},{\"id\":116875,\"name\":\"Bonnie Steiger\",\"character\":\"Sharon Sharalike\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":116878,\"name\":\"Richard Teran\",\"character\":\"Max\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":101183,\"name\":\"Sean Cain\",\"character\":\"Pelle Svanslos\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gg4xvFM7Vkb1jUVwmJCEilKtKx8.jpg\"},{\"id\":116879,\"name\":\"Jim Wright\",\"character\":\"Robert Svanslos\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":99911,\"name\":\"Randal Malone\",\"character\":\"Shaver's Manager\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oVJtShCZr2NNULcYZamzzd86Dlj.jpg\"},{\"id\":17626,\"name\":\"Serge Faurie\",\"character\":\"The Shaver\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":116880,\"name\":\"Yez Pinedo\",\"character\":\"Luna\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3308224,\"name\":\"Melanie Doyle\",\"character\":\"Pregnant Lady\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1400837,\"title\":\"Other Mom